OL,5,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FClaire has a tumour growing
OL,8,     Fbetween her brain and her nose.
OL,9,     FAnd if her surgeon can't mend the
OL,10,     Fhole he has to make in her skull
OL,11,     Fto get the tumour out, she risks
OL,12,     Fmeningitis.
OL,13,G0100 Murdered at First Sight
OL,14,     F...Gunshon In 2004, Michelle
OL,15,     FGunshon, a mother and security
OL,16,     Fguard, vanished in Birmingham. Her
OL,17,     Fbody was never found, but DNA
OL,18,     Fidentified her killer: Martin
OL,19,     FStafford, a violent offender.
