OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FMichelle, 18-weeks pregnant, is
OL,7,     Frushed to resus with concerns over
OL,8,     Fpotential conditions. Craig, 43,
OL,9,     Fstruggles to breathe after food
OL,10,     Fbecomes lodged in his oesophagus.
OL,11,G0250 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FDr Emma meets a man with a strange
OL,13,     Flooking lump on his arm. There's
OL,14,     Fan odd ear lump for Dr Magnus,
OL,15,     Fexploding head cysts for Dr Adil
OL,16,     Fand a large leg lump on a dance
OL,17,     Fteacher for Dr Dev.
